### create task
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Create Task",
    "date": "07-03-2026 14:30"
}

### get by id
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks?id=1

### get all
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks

### check error
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks?id=999

### delete task
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tasks?id=2

### put task (upgrade all task)
PUT http://localhost:8080/tasks?id=3 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Update task test",
    "date": "09-03-2026 14:30"
}

### patch task (name update)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/tasks?id=3 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "PATCH task test"
}

### patch task (date update)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/tasks?id=3 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "date": "09-02-2026 12:22"
}

### patch task (err test)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/tasks?id=3 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "date": "0"
}

### patch task (err test)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/tasks?id=3 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "date": ""
}